  "bug_report_content": "{\"id\":618,\"status\":\"Fixed\",\"summary\":\"Assignment removed when used as an expression result to Array.push\",\"labels\":[\"Type-Defect\",\"Priority-High\"],\"stars\":0,\"commentCount\":5,\"comments\":[{\"id\":0,\"commenterId\":-2876437220735395074,\"content\":\"\\u003cb\\u003eWhat steps will reproduce the problem?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\n1. Open online closure-compiler\\r\\n2. Input code:\\r\\n  function f() {\\r\\n    var a \\u003d [], b;\\r\\n    a.push(b \\u003d []);\\r\\n    b[0] \\u003d 1;\\r\\n    return a;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n3. Press [Compile]\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eWhat is the expected output? What do you see instead?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\nExcept OK.\\r\\nOutput: function f(){var a\\u003d[];a.push([]);return a}; //wrong\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eWhat version of the product are you using? On what operating system?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\nCurrent online version.\\r\\n\",\"timestamp\":1323362594,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":1,\"commenterId\":8173196008570380122,\"content\":\"Verified in simple and advanced mode in command line compiler as well.\",\"timestamp\":1323369536,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"commenterId\":-5060162230523776870,\"content\":\"Seems RemoveUnusedVariables is the culprit.\",\"timestamp\":1323385771,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":3,\"commenterId\":-5060162230523776870,\"content\":\"I have a fix pending.\",\"timestamp\":1323549109,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":4,\"commenterId\":1328304962299559429,\"content\":\"This issue was closed by revision r1674.\",\"timestamp\":1323796776,\"attachments\":[]}]}",
  "fix_diff": "--- com.google.javascript.jscomp.RemoveUnusedVars (buggy)\n+++ com.google.javascript.jscomp.RemoveUnusedVars (fixed)\n@@ -729,6 +729,7 @@\n             assignedToUnknownValue = true;\n           }\n \n+          boolean maybeEscaped = false;\n           for (Assign assign : assignsByVar.get(var)) {\n             if (assign.isPropertyAssign) {\n               hasPropertyAssign = true;\n@@ -736,9 +737,12 @@\n                 assign.assignNode.getLastChild(), true)) {\n               assignedToUnknownValue = true;\n             }\n-          }\n-\n-          if (assignedToUnknownValue && hasPropertyAssign) {\n+            if (assign.maybeAliased) {\n+              maybeEscaped = true;\n+            }\n+          }\n+\n+          if ((assignedToUnknownValue || maybeEscaped) && hasPropertyAssign) {\n             changes = markReferencedVar(var) || changes;\n             maybeUnreferenced.remove(current);\n             current--;\n@@ -901,7 +905,7 @@\n       this.nameNode = nameNode;\n       this.isPropertyAssign = isPropertyAssign;\n \n-      this.maybeAliased = !assignNode.getParent().isExprResult();\n+      this.maybeAliased = NodeUtil.isExpressionResultUsed(assignNode);\n       this.mayHaveSecondarySideEffects =\n           maybeAliased ||\n           NodeUtil.mayHaveSideEffects(assignNode.getFirstChild()) ||"
